# POST /seed — step 2: provision (or update) the local account we watch.
#
# `desk@pony.local.thanks.computer` — the domain is dev-local and
# auto-verified once bound to this stack (see the README's hostname
# add), which is why txco://imap/account accepts it. Re-seeding with the
# same password is a no-op update; a different password resets the
# login. Creating the account creates its INBOX. This is the SAME
# username the source's `user` field names.
WHEN ._seed.password != ""
  EXEC "txco://imap/account"
    WITH username = "desk@pony.local.thanks.computer",
         password = ._seed.password,
         into = "_acct"
